The system prompt texts in hooks/prompts/ (orchestrator, role prompts, council
mode and its synthesis format) are adapted from oh-my-opencode-slim,
https://github.com/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim (src/agents/orchestrator.ts,
role-routing.ts, role-prompts.ts, council.ts and src/hooks/council-inject),
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Changes: rewritten for Claude Code's Agent tool and Pantheon's delegate,
delegate_result and delegate_cancel tools; opencode-only parts (todo
continuity, marketplace, wait_for_user, question, task_message) removed; the
librarian points to web search and the available documentation MCPs; every
role prompt ends with a line that lets a task's report format replace the
role's own. The rest of the plugin is new code.

The plugin was first developed in https://github.com/anderson-spider/claude-workflow-codex
(PR #4), a fork of https://github.com/scasella/claude-dynamic-workflows-codex
(MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Stephen Casella); none of that project's code remains.
